<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Message (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>message &lt;someone&gt; &lt;text&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>message Gnort A cold wind whispers your name.
</pre>
<p>Like echo, but for one person: shows your text, just as you write it, to 
someone anywhere in the game, asleep or awake. No name is added, so it 
reads like something happening to them; to speak to someone as yourself, 
use <a cmd='#'>Help Tell</a>. You are told "Ok.". It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Echo</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Broadcast</a>
</pre>




</div>